# Corn Souls rules for Cline
- Read HANDOFF_CLINE.md first.
- Work in test/ only (test/game.html). Never promote TEST to LIVE (scripts/sync_test_to_live.py, "PROMOTE TEST to LIVE.bat") without the owner's explicit approval.
- Every change: bump with scripts/bump_test_version.py, add a DEVELOPMENT.md entry at the top, add/update a test/validate-*.cjs suite (and list it in .github/workflows/validate.yml), run all suites + scripts/check_launcher_anchors.py, commit, push to main.
- Never put a // comment mid-line before more code in game.html: it silently disables the statements after it.
- Do only what the owner asked; ask when unsure.
